<template><view class="sim-page"><SiteHeader active="simulate"/><view class="sim-main">
<view v-if="s.step===-1" class="sim-intro"><text class="sim-kicker">AINPE · 航海方向模拟</text><text class="sim-title">这次，给商家做一条带货视频。</text><text class="sim-lead">接到一个虚构商家的需求，选商品、写脚本、排分镜，交一份能讨论的初稿。</text><view class="sim-chip-row"><text class="sim-chip">选品 · 脚本 · 分镜</text><text class="sim-chip">进度保存在当前设备</text></view><view class="sim-actions"><button class="sim-primary" @click="s.step=0">开始模拟 →</button></view><text class="sim-note">灵感来自往期 AI 视频带货航海；本练习由 AINPE 独立设计，商家、商品、对话与结果均为虚构。</text></view>
<view v-if="s.step>=0&&s.step<3" class="sim-box"><view class="sim-top"><button class="sim-small" @click="back">← 上一步</button><text>虚构商家 · 模拟练习</text><text>{{s.step+1}} / 3</text></view><view class="sim-progress"><view class="sim-progress-bar" :style="{width:((s.step+1)*100/3)+'%'}"/></view>
<template v-if="s.step===0"><text class="sim-kicker">01 / 接到需求</text><text class="sim-title">先选一个商品。</text><view class="sim-panel"><text class="sim-panel-title">商家 · 模拟消息</text><text class="sim-copy">我想做一条给手机用户看的短视频。希望是竖屏，让人看清商品，开头吸引人，结尾告诉大家下一步做什么。</text></view><view class="sim-choice-list"><button v-for="p in products" :key="p.id" class="sim-choice" :class="{selected:s.product===p.id}" @click="s.product=p.id">{{p.emoji}} {{p.name}} · {{p.detail}}</button></view><view class="sim-actions"><button class="sim-primary" :disabled="!product" @click="s.step=1">下一步：写脚本 →</button></view></template>
<template v-if="s.step===1"><text class="sim-kicker">02 / 写视频脚本</text><text class="sim-title">用你的话介绍{{product.name}}。</text><text class="sim-lead">不必追求完美，留空也能继续，模拟商家会指出缺项。</text><view class="sim-actions"><button class="sim-small" @click="example">填入虚构示例</button></view><label class="sim-field"><text class="sim-label">开头：怎样让人愿意看下去？</text><textarea class="sim-textarea" v-model="s.hook" maxlength="180" placeholder="例如：从日常问题说起"/></label><label class="sim-field"><text class="sim-label">核心卖点</text><textarea class="sim-textarea" v-model="s.feature" maxlength="180" placeholder="说清商品如何使用"/></label><label class="sim-field"><text class="sim-label">结尾行动引导</text><textarea class="sim-textarea" v-model="s.action" maxlength="180" placeholder="让观众知道下一步做什么"/></label><text class="sim-note">草稿仅保存在当前设备，请不要输入真实客户隐私。</text><view class="sim-actions"><button class="sim-primary" @click="s.step=2">下一步：排分镜 →</button></view></template>
<template v-if="s.step===2"><text class="sim-kicker">03 / 排分镜</text><text class="sim-title">让商家看到你的构思。</text><text class="sim-lead">生成的是文字分镜草稿，不是真实视频。</text><text class="sim-heading">选择画幅</text><view class="sim-actions"><button class="sim-choice" :class="{selected:s.ratio==='portrait'}" @click="setRatio('portrait')">竖屏 9:16</button><button class="sim-choice" :class="{selected:s.ratio==='landscape'}" @click="setRatio('landscape')">横屏 16:9</button></view><text class="sim-heading">选择分镜内容</text><view class="sim-choice-list"><button v-for="shot in shots" :key="shot.id" class="sim-choice" :class="{selected:s.shots.includes(shot.id)}" @click="toggle(shot.id)">{{s.shots.includes(shot.id)?'✓ ':''}}{{shot.label}} · {{shot.detail}}</button></view><button class="sim-secondary" @click="makePreview">生成分镜预览</button><view v-if="s.preview" class="sim-panel"><text class="sim-panel-title">脚本分镜预览 · {{product.name}} · {{s.ratio==='portrait'?'竖屏':'横屏'}}</text><view v-for="(shot,i) in selectedShots" :key="shot.id" class="sim-result-item"><text class="sim-panel-title">镜头 {{i+1}} · {{shot.label}}</text><text class="sim-copy">{{frameText(shot.id)}}</text></view><text class="sim-note">这是文字分镜，不会生成视频。</text></view><view class="sim-actions"><button class="sim-primary" :disabled="!s.preview" @click="s.step=3">提交给模拟商家 →</button></view></template></view>
<view v-if="s.step===3" class="sim-box"><text class="sim-kicker">模拟提交 · 客户反馈</text><text class="sim-title">{{issues.length?'商家希望再调整初稿':'商家收到了一份要素齐全的初稿'}}</text><text class="sim-lead">{{issues.length?'模拟商家：请再检查下面这些地方。':'模拟商家：这版能看到开头、商品介绍和收尾，也符合竖屏要求。'}}</text><view v-if="issues.length" class="sim-panel sim-bad"><text class="sim-panel-title">需要修改</text><text v-for="issue in issues" :key="issue" class="sim-copy">• {{issue}}</text></view><view class="sim-panel"><text class="sim-panel-title">回看你的交付</text><text class="sim-copy">商品：{{product.name}} · {{s.ratio==='portrait'?'竖屏':'横屏'}}</text><text class="sim-copy">开头：{{s.hook||'待填写'}}</text><text class="sim-copy">卖点：{{s.feature||'待填写'}}</text><text class="sim-copy">引导：{{s.action||'待填写'}}</text><text class="sim-copy">分镜：{{selectedShots.map(x=>x.label).join('、')}}</text></view><text class="sim-note">反馈按填写项与所选分镜生成，不是真实客户评价。</text><view class="sim-actions"><button class="sim-secondary" @click="s.step=2">返回修改</button><button class="sim-secondary" @click="reset">重新体验</button></view><SimCamp/></view>
</view><SiteFooter /></view></template>
<script setup>
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.vue';
import {reactive,computed,watch} from 'vue';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.vue';
import SimCamp from './SimCamp.vue';
const KEY='ainpe:uni:video-voyage:v1';
const initial=()=>({step:-1,product:'',hook:'',feature:'',action:'',ratio:'',shots:[],preview:false});
let saved={};try{const v=uni.getStorageSync(KEY);if(v&&typeof v==='object')saved=v;}catch{}
const s=reactive({...initial(),...saved,shots:Array.isArray(saved.shots)?saved.shots:[]});
watch(s,v=>{try{uni.setStorageSync(KEY,JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(v)));}catch{}},{deep:true});
const products=[{id:'cup',name:'随行保温杯',emoji:'☕',detail:'展示外观与日常使用场景',feature:'便于随身携带，适合日常饮水'},{id:'organizer',name:'桌面理线盒',emoji:'▦',detail:'展示外观与使用场景',feature:'把桌面线缆集中整理'}];
const shots=[{id:'problem',label:'场景开头',detail:'呈现用户遇到的小麻烦'},{id:'product',label:'商品展示',detail:'让观众看清商品'},{id:'use',label:'使用过程',detail:'用动作说明怎么用'},{id:'ending',label:'收尾引导',detail:'告诉观众下一步'}];
const product=computed(()=>products.find(x=>x.id===s.product));
const selectedShots=computed(()=>shots.filter(x=>s.shots.includes(x.id)));
const issues=computed(()=>{const v=[];if(!s.hook.trim())v.push('开头还没有填写');if(!s.feature.trim())v.push('商品卖点还没有填写');if(!s.action.trim())v.push('收尾引导还没有填写');if(s.ratio!=='portrait')v.push('画幅与商家的竖屏要求不同');if(!s.shots.includes('problem'))v.push('还没有场景开头分镜');if(!s.shots.includes('product'))v.push('还没有商品展示');if(!s.shots.includes('ending'))v.push('还没有收尾引导');return v;});
const back=()=>s.step=Math.max(-1,s.step-1);
const setRatio=id=>{s.ratio=id;s.preview=false;};
const toggle=id=>{s.shots=s.shots.includes(id)?s.shots.filter(x=>x!==id):[...s.shots,id];s.preview=false;};
const makePreview=()=>{if(!s.ratio||!s.shots.length){uni.showToast({title:'请选择画幅和至少一个分镜',icon:'none'});return;}s.preview=true;};
const example=()=>{s.hook=s.product==='cup'?'通勤路上想喝水，却总忘记带杯子？':'桌面线缆乱成一团，找东西都费劲？';s.feature=product.value.feature;s.action='想了解更多，可以看看商品详情。';};
const frameText=id=>id==='problem'?(s.hook||'开头文案待填写'):id==='product'?`${product.value.name}：${s.feature||'卖点待填写'}`:id==='use'?`展示${product.value.name}的使用动作。`:(s.action||'收尾引导待填写');
const reset=()=>uni.showModal({title:'重新体验',content:'清除此项目的草稿和进度？',success:r=>{if(r.confirm)Object.assign(s,initial());}});
</script>
<style src="./simulate.css"></style>
